rder-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal13 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal13 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal13 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal13 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal121111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal121111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal121111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal121111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal1111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal1111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal1111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n.imgstal1111 {-webkit-box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     box-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #7C7C7C;     border-radius:8%;}\n\n-->\n</style></head>\n\n<body>\n<div align=\"center\">\n   <table width=\"970\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n    <!--DWLayoutTable-->\n    \n    <tbody><tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#BADA8C\"><img src=\"images/index/cp_index.jpg\" alt=\"TNAU Agritech Portal\" title=\"TNAU Agritech Portal\" width=\"970\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" usemap=\"#Map16\"></td>\n    </tr> <tr>\n      <td width=\"708\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" bgcolor=\"#BADA8C\" class=\"style1\"><a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"../about_us/abt_us.html\" title=\"About Us\">About Us</a> | <a href=\"../success_stories/success_index.html\" title=\"Success Stories\">Success Stories</a> | <a href=\"../farm_association/farm_assoct.html\" title=\"Farmer's Association\">Farmers Association</a> | <a href=\"../farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html\">Farmers' Innovation</a> | <a href=\"../tnau_publish.html\" title=\"TNAU Publications\">Publications</a> | <a href=\"../contact.html\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact</a></td>\n      <td width=\"253\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#BADA8C\" style=\"height:22; vertical-align:middle;\">  \n  \n<form action=\"http://www.google.com/cse\" name=\"cse-search-box\" id=\"cse-search-box\">\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cx\" value=\"006946231307976124146:qlhbhb-aevy\">\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ie\" value=\"UTF-8\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" size=\"23\">\n                    <input type=\"submit\" name=\"sa\" value=\"Search\">\n        </form>    </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" class=\"style1\"><div align=\"left\">\n        <div align=\"left\" class=\"style12\"><span class=\"style33\">Post Harvest Diseases :: Fruits :: Mango</span></div>\n    </div>\n        <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\n          <tbody><tr>\n            <td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"head\"><strong> Stem End Rot:&nbsp;<em>Lasiodiplodia theobromae</em></strong></p>\n              <p align=\"left\" class=\"Style2\"><strong>Symptoms</strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n                <li>In fruits, the pericarp darkens near the base of the pedicel.</li>\n                <li>The affected area enlarges to form a circular, black patch which under humid atmosphere extends rapidly and turns the whole fruit completely black within two or three days.</li>\n                <li>The pulp becomes brown and softer.</li>\n              </ul>\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/posthar_mango/2.Mango stem end rot2.JPG\" width=\"250\" height=\"160\" class=\"imgstal13\"></td>\n    <td width=\"26%\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_3.jpg\" width=\"225\" height=\"247\" class=\"imgstal121111\"></td>\n    <td width=\"25%\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_4.jpg\" width=\"185\" height=\"173\" class=\"imgstal1111\"></td>\n    <td width=\"24%\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_2.jpg\" width=\"175\" height=\"225\" class=\"imgstal2\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>Darken pericarp</strong></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>Circular black patch</strong></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>severe infection</strong></td>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><strong>Infected fruits</strong></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"Style2\"><strong>Management</strong><br>\n</p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n  <li>Avoid harvesting immature fruit. Postharvest treatment with hot water and carbendazim (Spin Flo) is partially effective against stem end rot.</li>\n  <li>For control of stem end rot during controlled atmosphere storage, a dual treatment of hot carbendazim (Spin Flo) followed by prochloraz is necessary.</li>\n  <li>Fruit from orchards with a history of stem end rot losses should be rejected for long term storage. The severity of stem end rot can be assessed as follows.</li>\n  <li>Harvest 100 mature fruit at random from throughout the orchard.</li>\n  <li>Leave them untreated and store at 25° until they are fully ripe. Ideally, less than one-tenth and certainly no more than one-third of the fruit should develop symptoms of stem end rot by the time they are fully ripe.</li>\n  </ul>\n<p class=\"Style2\">Image Source:</p><a href=\"https://www.apsnet.org/publications/imageresources/Pages/tropical087.aspx\">https://www.apsnet.org/publications/imageresources/Pages/tropical087.aspx</a><br>  <a href=\"http://www.abc.net.au/site-archive/rural/nt/content/201210/s3604875.htm\">http://www.abc.net.au/site-archive/rural/nt/content/201210/s3604875.htm<br>\n</a>\n<p>S Iram and HMI Ahmad. Major Post Harvest Disease of Mango and their Management. 2013.&nbsp; <em>Intl. J. Agron. Plant. Prod. </em><strong>4 (12), </strong>pp: 3470-3484. </p></td>\n          </tr>\n      </tbody></table>           </td>\n    </tr>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><hr>\n        <span class=\"style9\"><a href=\"../index.html\" title=\"Home\">Home</a> | <a href=\"../about_us/abt_us.html\" title=\"About Us\">About Us</a> | <a href=\"../success_stories/success_index.html\" title=\"Success Stories\">Success Stories</a> | <a href=\"../farm_association/farm_assoct.html\" title=\"Farmers Association\">Farmers Association</a> <span class=\"style9\">| <a href=\"../farm_innovations/farm_innovations.html\">Farmers' Innovation</a></span> | <a href=\"../tnau_publish.html\" title=\"TNAU Publications\">Publications</a>  | <a href=\"../contact.html\" title=\"Contact Us\">Contact Us\n        </a></span><p></p>\n      <p class=\"style9\">© 2015 TNAU. All Rights Reserved.</p></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n<map name=\"Map16\" id=\"Map16\"><area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"631,82,687,102\" href=\"http://agritech.tnau.ac.in/\" title=\"Agritech Portal - English\">\n<area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"697,83,732,102\" href=\"../ta/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2_ta.html\" title=\"Agritech Portal - Tamil\">\n</map>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar gaJsHost = ((\"https:\" == document.location.protocol) ? \"https://ssl.\" : \"http://www.\");\ndocument.write(unescape(\"%3Cscript src='\" + gaJsHost + \"google-analytics.com/ga.js' type='text/javascript'%3E%3C/script%3E\"));\n</script><script src=\"https://ssl.google-analytics.com/ga.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\ntry {\nvar pageTracker = _gat._getTracker(\"UA-13067640-1\");\npageTracker._trackPageview();\n} catch(err) {}</script>\n\n\n\n</body></html>", "extracted_images": [{"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/index/cp_index.jpg", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2.html", "image_type": "disease_symptom", "source": "TNAU", "organization": "TNAU", "alt_text": "TNAU Agritech Portal", "score": 4}, {"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/posthar_mango/2.Mango stem end rot2.JPG", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2.html", "image_type": "disease_symptom", "source": "TNAU", "organization": "TNAU", "alt_text": "", "score": 4}, {"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_3.jpg", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2.html", "image_type": "disease_symptom", "source": "TNAU", "organization": "TNAU", "alt_text": "", "score": 4}, {"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_4.jpg", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2.html", "image_type": "disease_symptom", "source": "TNAU", "organization": "TNAU", "alt_text": "", "score": 3}, {"crop": "mango", "disease": "disease_symptom", "image_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/images/posthar_mango/stem_end_rot_2.jpg", "source_url": "https://agritech.tnau.ac.in/crop_protection/crop_prot_postharvest_mango_2.html", "image_type": "disease_symptom", "source": "TNAU", "organization": "TNAU", "alt_text": "", "score": 3}], "interactive_crawl_used": false}